<ul>
<li>Lines are spaced by how closely they belong: a heading sits with what's under it, and the items of a list read as one group.</li>
<li>Your pages stay yours when a device moves between Bite's builds: another device's sample pages never take their place.</li>
<li>Share as Image keeps every line whole.</li>
<li>Bite from GitHub now keeps itself up to date.</li>
</ul>
